},{"op":48,"name":"actor_appear","args":[193,90,55,3,0]},{"op":30,"name":"wait_frame","args":[]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&文官02\n参见丞相。"]},{"op":50,"name":"actor_move","args":[65535,193,0,48,55,3]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[3]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[193,6]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&文官02\n我是主公派来的使者。\n&曹操\n嗯，是有关荆州的事吧？\n&文官02\n是，我军几天前攻打荆州，\n已经全部占领了。"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[0,3]},{"op":56,"name":"set_attr","args":[0,15,0,258]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&曹操\n是吗？真是可喜可贺啊！\n请转告孙将军，\n我曹操由衷感到欣喜。"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[0,0]},{"op":56,"name":"set_attr","args":[0,15,0,255]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&文官02\n谢丞相。\n另外还有樊城的事……\n&曹操\n嗯，樊城……？\n&文官02\n目前还是关羽军占优势，\n主公请您马上派遣援军。\n&曹操\n是吗？曹某不胜感激。\n我军也正在商讨援军一事，\n谢谢孙将军的关怀。\n&文官02\n是。\n那么在下告辞了。"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[193,0]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[3]},{"op":50,"name":"actor_move","args":[65535,193,0,95,55,1]},{"op":49,"name":"actor_select","args":[65535,193,0,0,0,0,65535]},{"op":30,"name":"wait_frame","args":[]},{"op":1,"name":"if","args":[],"off":7311,"cond":{"op":5,"name":"test_flags","args":[[735],[]]},"end":84,"end_off":7783},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[19,6]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&司马懿\n东吴已经占领了整个荆州了？"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[19,0]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&曹操\n关羽不在他们才得手的，\n不过孙权也很能干。"]},{"op":51,"name":"actor_face","args":[1,0,3]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[3]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[1,3]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&夏侯惇\n孟德，樊城的情况可不妙啊。"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[1,0]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&曹操\n嗯，想不到派于禁和庞德增援，\n结果还是打不过关羽……\n关羽真不愧是个杰出的武将啊。"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[1,2]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&夏侯惇\n现在可不是佩服他的时候！"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[1,0]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[3]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[0,17]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&曹操\n嗯。\n好吧，马上前去救援樊城。\